    </header>
    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="2" relname="preparation">I know what you mean.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="8" relname="span">Add to this that technology is changing so quickly as you say,</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="7" relname="span">and it might be hard enough to keep up with the important areas of a web page that actually allow a business to make money.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="9" relname="span">I think the elderly and disabled users needs for web use will never be met to the same extent that the young and healthy are,</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="4" relname="volitional-cause">and I suspect it is because there isn't enough profit involved to do so.</segment>
        <group id="6" type="span"/>
        <group id="7" type="span" parent="6" relname="span"/>
        <group id="8" type="span" parent="3" relname="volitional-cause"/>
        <group id="9" type="span" parent="7" relname="nonvolitional-result"/>
    </body>
</rst>
